*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PEN0033
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-05-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 822
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0033.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY PEN0033C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> A=ACTIVE S=SUSPENDED C=COLLECTIONS
    05 ACCOUNT-STAT       PIC X VALUE 'A'.
    *> LATE PAYMENT PENALTY
    05 PENALTY-AMT        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM REPEAT-OFFENDER
    PERFORM 4100-TO-COLLECTIONS
    DISPLAY "ACCOUNT-STAT=" ACCOUNT-STAT
    DISPLAY "PENALTY-AMT=" PENALTY-AMT
    STOP RUN.
REPEAT-OFFENDER.
    *> REPEAT LATE PAYER SUSPENSION
    IF LATE-PMTS-YR >= 3
       AND DAYS-PAST-DUE > 45
        MOVE 'S' TO ACCOUNT-STAT
        ADD 50 TO PENALTY-AMT
    END-IF.
4100-TO-COLLECTIONS.
    *> COLLECTIONS REFERRAL
    IF DAYS-PAST-DUE > 60
        MOVE 'C' TO ACCOUNT-STAT
    END-IF.
